<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran rejected a Pakistani-brokered ceasefire with hours to spare before Trump's ultimatum to reopen the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> — calling the proposal detached from reality.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Israeli strikes have knocked out eighty-five percent of Iran's petrochemical exports and killed a third consecutive IRGC intelligence chief, while Trump threatened power plants and bridges across a nation where three point two million people are already displaced.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>The gap between Tehran's demand for a permanent end to hostilities and Washington's offer of a fifteen-day pause is now too wide for any mediator to bridge by tonight's deadline.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Vietnam's National Assembly unanimously elected Tô Lâm as both Communist Party chief and president — the first person to hold both roles since Ho Chi Minh.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>His rise came through anti-corruption purges that removed every rival, a consolidation playbook familiar from Beijing.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>One hundred million people are now governed by a single authority with no institutional check, even as the country faces American tariff investigations and fuel shortages.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Twelve million Sudanese are now displaced — the largest displacement crisis on earth.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Civil parties marked the seventh anniversary of the sit-in that once promised a democratic transition, while the military commander who crushed that movement invoked its legacy to justify continued control.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>No ceasefire talks are scheduled, and no major power is pressing for them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia arrested its most decorated living soldier at Sydney airport.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Ben Roberts-Smith won the Victoria Cross in Afghanistan, then sued the journalists who reported he'd killed unarmed prisoners — and lost on appeal in twenty twenty-three.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>He now faces five war crimes murder charges, more than a decade after the killings and only because reporters refused to stop digging.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia sentenced the former governor of Kursk to fourteen years in a penal colony.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Alexei Smirnov presided over the region when Ukraine launched its surprise incursion last August — convicted not of military failure but of taking bribes from contractors who built substandard border fortifications.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Authoritarian systems don't reform after humiliation... they find a scapegoat.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's finance minister called the war between the United States and Iran a systemic tremor threatening the global economy — not a regional conflict.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Nirmala Sitharaman warned that a Hormuz closure directly threatens India's primary oil import route, and six hundred eighty-eight billion dollars in reserves may not cushion the shock.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>When a G-twenty finance minister reaches for systemic-risk vocabulary, the economic establishment is preparing for contagion, not watching from the sidelines.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The US Securities and Exchange Commission is one step from publishing what it calls Regulation Crypto — a framework defining which token transactions count as securities.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>After years of suing projects with no advance rules, Chair Paul Atkins's proposal has cleared White House review and awaits formal publication.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>If it lands, crypto moves from legal gray zone to regulated asset class — and every exchange and fundraiser will need to know which side of the line they're on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Jamie Dimon told JPMorgan shareholders that blockchain-native competitors now rank as the bank's top structural threat.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Three rivals already run tokenized funds that bypass traditional settlement entirely, and JPMorgan's own blockchain unit is racing to catch up.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>It's a striking admission — the chief executive of the world's largest bank conceding that decentralized finance is eating into his core business.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>More than one hundred children have died of measles in Bangladesh — preventable deaths from a disease with a cheap, effective vaccine.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Two successive governments let vaccine stockpiles lapse during political transitions, allowing seven thousand five hundred suspected cases to emerge since mid-March.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>The <sub alias="World Health Organization">WHO</sub> and GAVI are now vaccinating children across eighteen districts, but this is a crisis response to a failure that never should've happened.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>After a federal court blocked his attempt to dissolve the CDC's vaccine advisory panel, Robert F. Kennedy Junior rewrote its charter instead.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>New membership criteria — drafted by the anti-vaccine group ICAN — drop immunization expertise requirements and grant Kennedy direct appointment power over the committee.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>When legal checks block destruction, institutional capture achieves the same goal by quieter means.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Nature study found that large AI foundation models performed worse than simpler ones when transferred to clinical decision-making at unfamiliar hospitals.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Seven models tested on cervical myelopathy prediction overfitted to local care patterns and collapsed at new sites.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>The assumption that bigger models generalize to everything is being challenged in the one domain where errors are measured in lives.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers identified the enzyme that links doxorubicin — one of oncology's most important chemotherapy drugs — to irreversible heart failure.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>The drug activates a protein called ALOX-five, which triggers iron-dependent cell death in cardiac tissue, and an existing asthma medication called zileuton blocked it in mice.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>If human trials confirm the finding, oncologists could lift the dosage ceiling that currently limits how much of the drug cancer patients can safely receive.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A robotics company called Generalist claims its GEN-one system has hit ninety-nine percent reliability across tasks from folding boxes to servicing vacuums.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Trained on five hundred thousand hours of wearable hand-capture data, the robot operates at three times the speed of its predecessor.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Physical AI has been stuck at demo quality for years — if this number holds in production, warehouse automation just crossed the threshold where deployment actually makes sense.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An anti-pornography app called Quittr exposed its users' ages, self-reported habits, and written confessions — including data from minors — for ten months through a misconfigured database.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>Three separate security researchers warned the company before media coverage finally forced a fix.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>The people most vulnerable to this kind of exposure trusted an app that couldn't be trusted with a basic firewall rule.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A developer released Ghost Pepper, a fully local speech-to-text app for macOS that sends no audio to the cloud.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>It runs entirely on-device using open-source models under an MIT license — no account, no subscription, no data leaving your machine.</s> <break time="300ms"/> <s>In an era where every voice assistant records and transmits what you say, two hundred seventy-six Hacker News upvotes suggest real demand for tools that simply... don't.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>